     A*
     A* - EBC Bill Transmission Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 03/03/2003 by C:62 for Project 48MFE
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from EBC.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PB901                     TEXT('EBC Bill Trans Info')
     A            B9NAME    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FEBCP file member')
     A            B9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A*           Upload date when FAB9P record created
     A*
     A            B9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            B9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from FEBCP
     A*           member to FAB1P
     A*
     A            B9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            B9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAB1P records have a value
     A*           in B1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the FEBCP member from being processed again.
     A*
     A            B9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Time')
     A*
     A            B9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            B9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            B9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            B9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            B9DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            B9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            B9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            B9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            B9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
